{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"胡须"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"胡须"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>胡须是 $2$-态射的一种特殊的"},{"Local":{"url":"横向复合","text":"横向复合"}},{"Plain":", 其中一个或多个 $2$-态射为恒等 $2$-态射.</p>\n"}]}}